From 7039405ebda5c1eb129f884a17f92fdf6422f79c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 02:00:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 39/50] Audit and balance pass after the modernization

Audit:
- tools/hack/validate.py checks every move, species, learnset, egg move,
  evolution, Pokedex list, item, trainer party, wild encounter and battle
  string for missing or inconsistent data.
- Fix: the Pokedex A-Z and type lists read past their end after the
  species limit was raised (now one entry per Pokedex number).
- Fix: Electivire and Farigiraf had an empty first ability slot; Motor
  Drive and Armor Tail are implemented for them.
- The AI no longer picks later moves that would do nothing (hazards
  already up, active Tailwind/Trick Room, set-up moves at +2, ...).

Balance (tools/hack/balance.py):
- Gym Leaders from Lt. Surge on, the Elite Four and the Champion use some
  newer moves; levels unchanged.
- Peak teams get modern sets and some later evolutions.
- Modern tutor tiers use effective power and gate strong utility moves.
- The newer held evolution items are sold from the 5th badge.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
